#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:61
msgid ""
"You can ask Orca for the _basic Where Am I_ with any object on the screen. "
"For most widgets, Orca at least tells you the label or name, the type or "
"role of the widget, and the mnemonic or accelerator key if they exist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:63
msgid ""
"For example, in tables, basic Where Am I gives you details about the table "
"cell that you are in. In text, it presents the current line along with any "
"text which is selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:65
msgid "Perform basic Where Am I:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:72
msgid "{kbd}`CapsLock+Enter`"
msgstr "{kbd}`CapsLock+Enter`"

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:78
msgid "{kbd}`Insert+Enter`"
msgstr "{kbd}`Insert+Enter`"

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:81
msgid "Detailed information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:83
msgid ""
"Only certain objects provide the _detailed Where Am I_ information. These "
"objects contain a lot of information that you may wish to know, but only on "
"demand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:85
msgid ""
"For example, if you are in the spell checker of an application where Orca "
"provides enhanced support, the basic Where Am I repeats the spelling error. "
"The detailed Where Am I presents the full details of the error. The detailed "
"Where Am I also tells you the position in a progress bar, the status of "
"check boxes and radio buttons, the children in a tree object, the type of a "
"link or the cell coordinates in a table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:87
msgid "Perform detailed Where Am I:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:94
