msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:625
msgid "Return to a bookmark"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:627
msgid ""
"You can navigate to the bookmark later, even if you haven't permanently "
"saved the bookmarks associated with your current environment. You can find "
"the bookmark based on its number, or you can browse the saved bookmarks just "
"like Structural Navigation objects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/accessibility/orca/navigate-the-screen-using-the-screen-reader.md:629
msgid ""
"When you select a bookmark, the exact behavior depends on the current "
"environment. If you are in web content, the caret moves to the bookmark so "
"that you can continue reading. Otherwise, Flat Review activates and the "
"bookmark becomes the current review item."
msgstr ""

